OL,3,GNEWSASwan on railway line causing train
OL,4,Adelays
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail services have been delayed due to
OL,7,Fa swan on the tracks.
OL,9,FGreat Northern said the swan was on the
OL,10,Fline in the Peterborough area and as a
OL,11,Fresult some lines were blocked.
OL,13,FNo trains were able to run from
OL,14,FPeterborough towards Hitchin in
OL,15,FHertfordshire for more than an hour.
OL,17,FResidual disruption is expected until
OL,18,F10:30 BST, Network Rail has said.
